    'pages' => [
        ['about', 'About BodaERP', 'What BodaERP is for, how it works and who uses it.', $page(
            '<p>BodaERP keeps one record of every boda-boda rider in a city: who they are, which stage they work from, whether their permit is paid and when it runs out.</p>',
            '<h2>Why it matters</h2>',
            '<p>When riders and permit fees are tracked on paper at each stage, a council cannot see who has paid, an officer cannot check a permit at the roadside, and a rider has no easy way to prove they are legal. Passengers have no way to know who is carrying them.</p>',
            '<h2>How it works</h2>',
            '<ul><li><strong>The council</strong> sets its stages, the yearly permit fee and the grace period.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Stage chairpersons</strong> register the riders at their stage, record payments and hand out ID cards.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Riders</strong> see their permit, download receipts and renew by mobile money.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Anyone</strong> can scan the QR code on an ID card, or type the permit number on this website, to see whether the permit is valid.</li></ul>',
            '<h2>Who it is for</h2>',
            '<p>City councils, because they set the fee and answer for road safety. Chairpersons, because they already know their riders. Riders, because a provable permit keeps them working. Government, because national planning needs the same figures from every city.</p>'
        ), 'About BodaERP | Boda-boda permits for Ugandan cities', 'Why boda-boda riders need to be registered, how BodaERP registers them at their stage and collects permit fees, and the councils and riders it serves.', 1],

        ['privacy-policy', 'Privacy Policy', 'How BodaERP collects, uses and protects personal data.', $page(
            '<p>This policy explains how Kakebe Technologies Limited ("we") handles personal data in BodaERP, in line with Uganda\'s Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019.</p>',
            '<h2>What we collect</h2>',
            '<ul><li><strong>Riders:</strong> name, National Identification Number (NIN), date of birth, gender, phone, email (optional), address, next of kin, motorcycle plate and model, stage, photo, and permit payments.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Staff accounts:</strong> name, email, phone, role, and the city or stage they work for.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Everyone:</strong> sign-in times, IP address and browser type, kept in the security log.</li>',
            '<li><strong>Contact form:</strong> what you write to us and how to reach you.</li></ul>',
            '<h2>Why we use it</h2>',
            '<p>To register riders with their city council, record and verify permit payments, issue ID cards, send renewal reminders and receipts, prevent fraud, and keep the system secure.</p>',
            '<h2>Who can see it</h2>',
            '<p>A stage chairperson sees riders at their stage. A city council sees riders in its city. The national government portal sees records across participating cities. Mobile-money payments are processed by our payment provider, ioTec Pay. We do not sell personal data.</p>',
            '<h2>How long we keep it</h2>',
            '<p>Rider and payment records are kept for as long as the city council requires them for revenue and enforcement records. Security logs are kept for up to 12 months.</p>',
            '<h2>Your rights</h2>',
            '<p>You can ask for a copy of your data, ask for mistakes to be corrected, or object to processing. Riders can download their data and send these requests from their portal (My account → Privacy and your data). Anyone can also use the contact page.</p>',
            '<h2>Security</h2>',
            '<p>Passwords are stored only as secure hashes, connections should use HTTPS, and every change to a record is written to an audit log.</p>'
        ), 'Privacy policy | BodaERP', 'How BodaERP collects, uses, shares and protects the personal data of boda-boda riders, stage chairpersons and council staff, and the rights each one has.', 1],

        ['terms-of-service', 'Terms of Service', 'The rules for using BodaERP.', $page(
            '<p>These terms apply to everyone who uses BodaERP, operated by Kakebe Technologies Limited.</p>',
            '<h2>Accounts</h2>',
            '<p>Accounts are created by an administrator, a city council or a stage chairperson. Keep your password private and tell your administrator straight away if you think someone else has used your account. You are responsible for what is done with your account.</p>',
            '<h2>Correct information</h2>',
            '<p>Staff who register riders or record payments must enter true and complete information. Recording a payment that was not received, or registering a rider with false details, is misuse of the system and may be reported to the city council.</p>',
            '<h2>Payments</h2>',
            '<p>Permit fees are set by each city council. A payment is complete only when it shows as Confirmed and a receipt number has been issued. Refunds follow the city council\'s rules.</p>',
            '<h2>Availability</h2>',
            '<p>We work to keep BodaERP available at all times, but it may be paused briefly for maintenance. We are not liable for losses caused by outages beyond our reasonable control.</p>',
            '<h2>Changes</h2>',
            '<p>We may update these terms. The date of the latest change is shown on this page.</p>'
        ), 'Terms of service | BodaERP', 'The terms for riders, stage chairpersons, city councils and government officers who use BodaERP to register riders, pay permit fees and check permits.', 1],

        ['cookie-policy', 'Cookie Policy', 'Which cookies BodaERP uses and why.', $page(
            '<p>BodaERP uses as few cookies as possible.</p>',
            '<table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Purpose</th><th>How long</th></tr></thead><tbody>',
            '<tr><td>bodaerp_session</td><td>Keeps you signed in while you use the site</td><td>Until you close the browser or sign out</td></tr>',
            '<tr><td>bodaerp_remember</td><td>Only if you tick "Keep me signed in": signs you back in on this device</td><td>Up to 30 days</td></tr>',
            '</tbody></table>',
            '<p>Your answer to the cookie notice is stored in your browser\'s local storage, not in a cookie. We do not use advertising, analytics or third-party tracking cookies.</p>'
        ), 'Cookie policy | BodaERP', 'BodaERP sets only the cookies that keep you signed in and remember your cookie choice. This site has no tracking or advertising cookies.', 1],
        ['photo-credits', 'Photo credits', 'The photographers whose pictures appear on this website.', $page(
